  "content": "\n\n<pre><span style=\"font-family:'times new roman', times, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">《真三》關羽梗圖<br><br>此模組不提供新武器或道具，僅為 Epic Fight 新增一種武器類型。</span><br></span><br></span></pre>\n<pre><span style=\"color:#f00\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:'times new roman', times, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">因此你需要搭配我已相容的模組遊玩：<span style=\"font-size:24px\"><a style=\"color:#f00\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/spartan-weaponry\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Spartan Weaponry(長戟)</a></span>, <span style=\"font-size:24px\"><a style=\"color:#f00\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-knights-armor-and-weapons\" rel=\"nofollow\">Epic Knights(羅夏伯戰斧)</a></span> 或 <span style=\"font-size:24px\"><a style=\"color:#f00\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dungeons-gear\" rel=\"nofollow\">Dungeons Gear(長戟)</a></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:'times new roman', times, serif\"><span><span style=\"font-size:18px\">，我已為其提供相容性支援<br>或是自行<span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#f00\"><span style=\"font-family:'times new roman', times, serif\"><span><strong>製作 Datapack</strong></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fepicfight-docs.readthedocs.io%252fen%252flatest%252fGuides%252fpage2%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#f00\"><span style=\"font-family:'times new roman', times, serif\"><span><strong>製作 Datapack</strong></span></span></span></a></span><span style=\"color:#f00\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:'times new roman', times, serif\"><span><span style=\"font-size:18px\">來將武器類型定義為 Falchion（彎刀）。<br></span></span></span></span></pre>\n<pre><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#f90\">強烈建議搭配<span style=\"font-size:24px\"><a style=\"color:#f90\" href=\"https://beta.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/epic-fight-animations/files\" rel=\"nofollow\">Epic Fight Animations 資源包</a></span>遊玩。</span></pre>\n<pre><span><span style=\"font-family:'times new roman', times, serif;font-size:14px\"><br>Datapack 範例：</span><br><br><span style=\"font-family:'times new roman', times, serif;font-size:14px\">{{ \"attributes\": { \"common\": { \"armor_negation\":7.0, \"impact\":1.5, \"max_strikes\":2 } }, \"type\":\"falchion\"}<br><br></span></span></pre>\n<pre><span style=\"font-size:18px\">此招式表包含三種普通攻擊與三種特殊技能。<br>根據你輸入的方向，會有三種不同的特殊技能。<br><strong>無畏被動（Fearless）：</strong>第三次普通攻擊不會被敵人攻擊打斷。<br><strong>前進方向 + 特殊技能：</strong>向前進行兩次快速的向上斬擊，可有效擊退敵人。<br><strong>左/右方向 + 特殊技能：</strong>快速的斜向斬擊，無法被敵人攻擊打斷。<br><strong>後退方向 + 特殊技能：</strong>掃過廣大範圍後，對敵人進行斬擊使其倒地。可於空中使用斬擊，對倒地的敵人進行額外攻擊。<br></span></pre>\n<pre><span>&nbsp;<br><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/h2cNB7Z/falchion-normal-attack.gif\" alt=\"彎刀普通攻擊\" width=\"600\" height=\"338\"><br><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/PNvgmdV/Falchion-Forward-Attack.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"338\"><br></span></pre>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/g9y38DL/Falchion-Backward-Attack.gif\" alt=\"彎刀後退攻擊\" width=\"600\" height=\"338\"></p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/L92vCBv/Falchion-Side-Attack.gif\" alt=\"彎刀側向攻擊\" width=\"600\" height=\"338\"></p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
